# Claude Code local state and agent worktrees (transient). Only the role agent
# wrappers are tracked; the directory itself must be un-ignored as /.claude/*,
# because git cannot re-include a file under an ignored directory. **/ keeps nested
# .claude/ state (apps/web/.claude/settings.local.json, worktrees) ignored at every depth.
**/.claude/*
!/.claude/agents/

# husky regenerates its hook wrappers under .husky/_/ on install and drops its own
# _/.gitignore there. Track that ignore here too so a fresh clone or a copy made
# before that file exists (e.g. an rsync of the skeleton) never stages the
# generated wrappers. Only .husky/pre-commit is tracked.
.husky/_/
